 "summary": "The new exponent-comparison material (exponent inclusion on (0,1)-forms, its dense range, the L\u00b9 bound on annihilators, cokernel and index independence) has no counterpart in Mathlib or Tau Ceti, and the nested-chart-sets lemma is moved rather than copied. The cokernel and index results reuse main's `LinearMap.cokerEquivOfRegularity` and `IsFredholm.index_eq_of_regularity`, and the density proofs reuse `denseRange_ofContMDiffSection` and `ofExponentLEL_ofContMDiffSection`.",
